      "description": "OpenAI and its CEO Sam Altman are facing 30 new lawsuits that accuse them of providing \"substantial assistance and encouragement\" to the suspect in Canada's Tumbler Ridge school shooting, as reported earlier by TechCrunch. The new wave of lawsuits was filed in a California federal court on Wednesday by the students, teachers, and the principal [&#8230;]",
